# Cursor Rules for jcmcginnis.com

Read `AGENTS.md` and `README.md` first; they hold the full workspace rules and writing workflow.

## Two apps

- **Astro app:** `site/`, canonical content, deployed to Cloudflare Pages previews at
  <https://jcmcginnis.pages.dev/>. Production branch `main`.
- **Legacy Bridgetown app:** repo root, still serving <https://jcmcginnis.com> from GitHub Pages
  until the DNS cutover.

Never edit `src/_posts` and `site/src/content` as two sources of truth. `site/src/content` is
canonical for the Astro app.

## Commands

```bash
mise run site:up      # Install Astro dependencies
mise run site:start   # Astro dev server at http://localhost:4321
mise run site:build   # Validate versions, then build site/dist/
mise run site:lint    # astro check + check:versions + Prettier check

mise run up           # Legacy: install Bridgetown dependencies
mise run start        # Legacy: Bridgetown dev server at http://localhost:4000
mise run build        # Legacy: production build
mise run lint -a      # Legacy: lint and autocorrect
```

Root `mise run lint` covers the Bridgetown app only; it does not format `site/`.

## Content paths

```
site/src/content/essays/<slug>/index.md   # current essay body + versions log
site/src/content/essays/<slug>/rev-NN.md  # older published body, body-only; do not edit
site/src/content/drafts/                  # drafts; generate no routes
site/src/content/talks/                   # talks
site/src/data/                            # career, readme, menu, socials, metadata, redirects
```

Start a rewrite with
`npm --prefix site run revision:start -- <slug> --summary "..." --then "..." --now "..." --note "..."`
before the first edit. Keep the original publication date and never fabricate a revision. Mark
meaningful passages with `:::changed{since="rev-NN"}` and keep `<!-- prettier-ignore -->` above it.

## Agent instructions

- Run `mise run site:lint` after changing the Astro app or its content.
- Run `mise run lint -a` after changing the legacy Bridgetown app.
- DNS is not cut over. Do not change DNS or add custom domains without explicit approval; do not
  delete the Pages project.
- Do not rewrite essay prose, career copy, or design direction unless the task asks for it.

## Legacy file layout

The root app keeps `src/_posts/`, `src/_layouts/`, `src/_partials/`, and `src/_data/` for the
Bridgetown build. Do not create posts there as part of normal writing; new editorial work goes to
`site/src/content/`.
